quadrf-mesh (0.1.5-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * debian: Document /etc/default/quadrf-lora-phy as operator RF config
  * mesh: Drop FPGA interleave mode, it was dumb to have
  * phy: Restore post-TX RX gain from live 0x6A snapshot
  * phy: Default RX polarization to RHCP for co-polarized mesh hops
  * phy: Add channel SNR, SIR, and LVL; propagate through Air-IPC and monitor
  * phy: reduce RX gain during TX and drop PA drain to 0 ms
  * mesh: Spawn monitor outside NoNewPrivileges sandbox
  * mesh: Drop Open Web UI launch and fix RX mode parse
  * debian: Name the applications launcher Mesh

